			<div class="content" id="post-content-4277251">
									

<p>This is such a good SCP. It's optimistic, wide scale and very easy to understand. I loved the tidbit about Gaia dying during mass extinctions including the current Anthropocene and how the Foundation explicitly funds those who are helping the Earth. The latter makes me very happy. It's always funny that the Foundation made sure to include the concerns about its their goals and normalcy even when it comes to the entity that represents all life on Earth.</p>
<p>I hope there is more involvement with this SCP in tales and whatnot in the future. You did a great job and I give it a +1. It's a new favorite for me.</p>

